        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.87,
          "end": 88.82,
          "en": "if you later also distribute your app as a standalone app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.82,
          "end": 90.6,
          "en": "Now we can get those permissions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "with help of this Notifications package again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 96.00999999999999,
          "en": "And you also find this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 96.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "here in the official docs, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "There, you can also learn how to ask for permissions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.793,
          "en": "and how to get permissions, and so on.",
