        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.49000000000001,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "So what I'll do here is I'll add a little helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 111.267,
          "en": "a function which I'll name setupPushNotifications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 115.803,
          "en": "or configurePushNotifications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.85900000000001,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "And this is a async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 122.62,
          "en": "and that's why I'm creating a separate function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.62,
          "end": 124.94,
          "en": "because we shouldn't add the async keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 124.94,
          "end": 126.8,
          "en": "in front of the effect function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.8,
          "end": 130.113,
          "en": "That's not something you should do with userEffect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.3,
          "end": 133.7,
          "en": "But here in configurePushNotifications,",
