        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.7,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "we can now use async await.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 139.31,
          "en": "And I will start by using the Notifications package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.31,
          "end": 142.223,
          "en": "and there, we can call getPermissionsAsync.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.8,
          "end": 146.5,
          "en": "This is a method which returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.5,
          "end": 148.6,
          "en": "which eventually will tell us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.6,
          "end": 153.52,
          "en": "what the permission status of this app on this device is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 153.52,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "So here we can await the result of that promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.24,
          "end": 158.64,
          "en": "And what we get back is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 161.48,
          "en": "which we can destructure with this syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.48,
          "end": 163.703,
          "en": "to pull out the status property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.15,
          "end": 167.01,
          "en": "The status property will tell us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 167.01,
          "end": 171.46,
          "en": "whether we currently have permission to get such a PushToken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.46,
          "end": 175.51,
          "en": "and to get Push Notifications or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.51,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "Now I will add a helper variable, finalStatus here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 181.163,
          "en": "which I said equal to the status I got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.06,
          "end": 183.58,
          "en": "And then we can add a if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.58,
          "end": 188.58,
          "en": "and check if finalStatus is maybe not equal to granted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.12,
          "end": 192.97,
          "en": "which means we don't have permission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.97,
          "end": 195.35,
          "en": "Now, granted is one of the possible values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.35,
          "end": 197.083,
          "en": "that can be stored in status.",
