        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.92000000000002,
          "end": 200.11,
          "en": "So if this is not granted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.11,
          "end": 203.11,
          "en": "then we know that we need to ask for permission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.11,
          "end": 204.01,
          "en": "So therefore then,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 204.01,
          "end": 206.78,
          "en": "I will also use this Notifications package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 206.78,
          "end": 210.683,
          "en": "and call the requestPermissionsAsync method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.52,
          "end": 213.66,
          "en": "So now that we know that we don't have permissions,",
