        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.11,
          "end": 229.5,
          "en": "And now after requesting permissions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.5,
          "end": 232.84,
          "en": "the user either granted the permissions or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.84,
          "end": 235.76,
          "en": "So we can then set the final status to this new status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 235.76,
          "end": 237.51,
          "en": "which we got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 237.51,
          "end": 240.26,
          "en": "And then we can add another if check thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
